{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1078074-thought-experiment-soul-arcana-tremere-win","id":1078074,"title":"Thought Experiment: Soul Arcana / Tremere Win","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-04-13T18:28:47-07:00","id":1078074,"title":"Thought Experiment: Soul Arcana / Tremere Win","content":"So thought experiment.<br /> <br /> The Tremere win, and somehow release the father dragon, and the truth of the unified nature of the soul onto reality.<br /> <br /> What do we think would happen? Would the five subtle arcana have pieces of them taken and absorbed into a single arcana of &quot;Soul&quot;? Do you think we would have some sort of merger of twilight and shadow or something similar? would the fundamental nature of souls change at all?<br /> <br /> I have given this alot of thought and i just kinda wanted to get someone else's thoughts on this matter since the only other people i could talk to this about are in the game i'm running.<br /> <br /> Thanks,<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13276-bristark","name":"Bristark","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13276_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-13T18:43:07-07:00","id":1078080,"title":"","content":"Assuming this topic doesn't die and is carried on by people who know a lot more than me, can I add a question to this? How would this synergize with Mummy's metaphysics?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7967-scarlet-witch","name":"Scarlet Witch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"498"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-14T15:40:46-07:00","id":1078592,"title":"","content":"Okay an update!<br /> <br /> I was reading through the Dark Ages book and it described a group called Weret-Hekau that defined the 5 pieces of the soul as they pertain to the subtle arcana i have paraphrased those parts below;<br /> <br /> Fate (Ren): The soul's name<br /> Mind: (Ba), the part of the soul that contains the identity and passions<br /> Death (Sheut): shadow-aspect of the soul<br /> Prime (Ka), or soul\u2019s vital essence<br /> Spirit (Ab): the heart as the emotional aspect of the soul.<br /> <br /> Then we can take the information from left hand path about the Tremere and their holy book &quot;The Suspire&quot;<br /> <br /> \u201cWhat is the soul?\u201d<br /> The Dragon of the Aether said, \u201cThe soul is the fiery well of life and sorcery: spark of Prime.\u201d<br /> The Dragon of Arcadia said, \u201cThe soul sets the cosmos in its course. It is the winding vine of Fate.\u201d<br /> The Dragon of Pandemonium said, \u201cThe soul is the will, for desire defines the Self against the riot of Space. It is Mind: the original demon of \u2018I am.\u2019\u201d<br /> The Dragon of the Primal Wild said, \u201cThe soul is the meaning of things: the Spirit which turns lust to love, and shape into beauty.\u201d<br /> The Dragon of Stygia said, \u201cThe soul moves on.\u201d<br /> <br /> So my thought is that i can sorta build upon this to build a true arcana, and if it overlaps with the other arcana all the better being that the idea of the dragon father is that they wanted to give the truth of the soul to mankind, but instead it's nature was split among the subtle arcana.<br /> <br /> So im going to try and noodle though this....and how to define what each practice could do with this as a framework. If anyone has any ideas i would really like to hear them!<br /> <br /> Thanks,","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13276-bristark","name":"Bristark","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13276_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-27T22:27:03-07:00","id":1084896,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/919340-on-souls-a-discourse\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/919340-on-souls-a-discourse\"> On Souls, a Discourse - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/919340-on-souls-a-discourse\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/919340-on-souls-a-discourse </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> So a friend and I were reflecting on the notion of a five part soul based on the Subtle Arcana (similar to another post by Wyrdhamster (http://forum.theonyxpath.com/ </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> This is a link to an essay called On Souls, a Discourse which might give you some ideas. It goes into how which pillars of the soul in Mummy correspond to a particular subtle arcanum and what the removal of each these parts would mean for the victim. Also lists the spells that affect the soul.<br /> <br /> I'm sorry that I'm so late in responding; I had to get an account to post on the Onyx path forums and wait a few weeks for access. I've subscribed to the thread.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13289-inhiding","name":"inhiding","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-03T15:07:08-07:00","id":1087350,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>inhiding</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1078074-thought-experiment-soul-arcana-tremere-win?p=1084896#post1084896\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/919340-on-souls-a-discourse\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...ls-a-discourse</a><br /> <br /> <br /> This is a link to an essay called On Souls, a Discourse which might give you some ideas. It goes into how which pillars of the soul in Mummy correspond to a particular subtle arcanum and what the removal of each these parts would mean for the victim. Also lists the spells that affect the soul.<br /> <br /> I'm sorry that I'm so late in responding; I had to get an account to post on the Onyx path forums and wait a few weeks for access. I've subscribed to the thread.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is perfect thank you!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13276-bristark","name":"Bristark","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13276_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}